      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BURNING KUNA (8) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished in the minors latest when third (22.16) at this track and may be close to breaking through. Form here sound including three wins. Deserves serious consideration. SPACE ZOOMER (5) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 1.3 lengths into second (22.15) at this track in a Grade 6 over 381m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Expected to be in this for a long way. SHAKE NOT STIR (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing seventh (30.72) last time in a Grade 5 at Northam. Has a strong winning record at this journey. Strong form has emerged from his last run. One of the better chances. LARA MAGIC (2) comes here off a freshen-up and is worth consideration.",
